# CVE-2026-32281: Go crypto/x509 DoS via inefficient certificate chain validation
# CVE-2026-32283: Go TLS key update message flood
# Affects: restic binary (embedded Go stdlib v1.25.7)
# Fixed in: Go 1.25.9 / 1.26.2 (kubectl patched via v1.35.5)
# Action: remove once restic ships with Go 1.26.2+
CVE-2026-32281
